	"title": "Xanathar's Guide to Everything",
	"description": "<p><em>Xanathar's Guide to Everything</em> is the first major expansion for fifth edition Dungeons &amp; Dragons, offering new rules and story options for your game.</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Unlock <strong>27&nbsp;different subclasses</strong>, like <strong>the Hexblade Warlock</strong> and <strong>the Swashbuckler</strong> in the Character Builder<br />&bull;&nbsp;<strong>52 new spells</strong>, <strong>15 unique feats</strong>, and <strong>50 magical item</strong>s and see their details with a click on your character sheet<br />&bull;&nbsp;<strong>New tools</strong> to give Dungeon Masters&nbsp;new ways to use <strong>traps</strong>, <strong>magic items</strong>, and <strong>downtime activities</strong> in your game<br />&bull;&nbsp;<strong>A brand new system</strong> to give your characters a unique and new backstory&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Complete the core D&amp;D collection:<br />-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/tashas-cauldron-of-everything?icid_source=xgtemp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=tcoe\" target=\"_blank\">Tasha's Cauldron of Everything</a><strong><a href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/players-handbook?icid_source=dmgmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo\" target=\"_blank\"><br /></a></strong></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/players-handbook?icid_source=xgtemp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=phb\">Player's Handbook</a></span><br />-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/dungeon-masters-guide?icid_source=xgtemp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=dmg\">Dungeon Master's Guide</a></span></span><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/volos-guide-to-monsters?icid_source=xgtemp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=vgtm\"><br /></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/monster-manual?icid_source=xgtemp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=mm\">Monster Manual</a></span></span></p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This purchase unlocks the contents of this source for use with D&amp;D Beyond, including the book in digital format in the game compendium&nbsp;and access options from the book in the searchable listings, character builder, and digital sheet.</span></p>",
